(5861352, 853119, 110041, '<td valign="top">Silhouettes of branches and reflections look nice and sharp. Some good colours going on.<br/> <br/>Would be better in landscape rather than portrait.<br/> <br/>Awkward aspect reduces the impact of the photo - especially the branches at the top.<br/> <br/>You don''t need the railings (which would help with the aspect ratio).<br/> <br/>Rule of thirds with the horizon may well help. <br/> <br/>Is that a spot of sensor dust in the water?</td>', 'Silhouettes of branches and reflections look nice and sharp. Some good colours going on. Would be better in landscape rather than portrait. Awkward aspect reduces the impact of the photo - especially the branches at the top. You don''t need the railings (which would help with the aspect ratio). Rule of thirds with the horizon may well help.  Is that a spot of sensor dust in the water?', '2010-02-10 04:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
