(5862215, 852947, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse with rich color.  Pose makes it look like the horse is avoiding interacting.  I think for this challenge I''d like to see eye contact or some visual indication of who it is he''s friends with, so the image tells the story even without a title.</td>', 'Beautiful horse with rich color.  Pose makes it look like the horse is avoiding interacting.  I think for this challenge I''d like to see eye contact or some visual indication of who it is he''s friends with, so the image tells the story even without a title.', '2010-02-10 16:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
