(5862221, 853165, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather shallow DOF, but if he was eating than thank you for blurring out the gorey bits.  Like the creamy bokeh in the background.</td>', 'Rather shallow DOF, but if he was eating than thank you for blurring out the gorey bits.  Like the creamy bokeh in the background.', '2010-02-10 16:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
