(5864024, 853234, 63633, '<td valign="top">The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation. <br/> <br/>Regarding the image itself, I find it to be very dark, with image quality issues, particularly through the trees. Must have been a sight to see though - turkeys chasing deer :)</td>', 'The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation.  Regarding the image itself, I find it to be very dark, with image quality issues, particularly through the trees. Must have been a sight to see though - turkeys chasing deer :)', '2010-02-11 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864026, 853143, 63633, '<td valign="top">The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation. <br/> <br/>Regarding the image itself, it is very small (doesn''t go up to the maximum of 800 pixels) and for a black &amp; white, seems a bit muddy. Maybe you could have used the image title to convey your intention (link to the challenge) a bit better.</td>', 'The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation.  Regarding the image itself, it is very small (doesn''t go up to the maximum of 800 pixels) and for a black & white, seems a bit muddy. Maybe you could have used the image title to convey your intention (link to the challenge) a bit better.', '2010-02-11 23:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864029, 853160, 63633, '<td valign="top">OK, I looked up your title, and now I get that it''s a Green Day song. I suspect though that most voters will be just going "huh?".<br/> <br/>In regards to your image, I like that you have removed distractions from the background by using a white backdrop, but it would turn out better I think if you placed your subject a little further away from the backdrop so that backdrop itself isn''t in focus. Your focus seems to have missed your subject slightly, and your exposure is not great on the subject either, because the hand grenade just looks like a black blob, there is no detail perceivable.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be negative, it''s just that I like to explain my low votes.</td>', 'OK, I looked up your title, and now I get that it''s a Green Day song. I suspect though that most voters will be just going "huh?". In regards to your image, I like that you have removed distractions from the background by using a white backdrop, but it would turn out better I think if you placed your subject a little further away from the backdrop so that backdrop itself isn''t in focus. Your focus seems to have missed your subject slightly, and your exposure is not great on the subject either, because the hand grenade just looks like a black blob, there is no detail perceivable. Sorry to be negative, it''s just that I like to explain my low votes.', '2010-02-11 23:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864030, 852406, 63633, '<td valign="top">The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation. <br/> <br/>Regarding the image itself - I like your duotone and the graininess of your image.</td>', 'The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation.  Regarding the image itself - I like your duotone and the graininess of your image.', '2010-02-11 23:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864031, 853108, 63633, '<td valign="top">The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation. <br/> <br/>Regarding the image itself, it is well focussed but the composition is not particularly interesting.</td>', 'The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation.  Regarding the image itself, it is well focussed but the composition is not particularly interesting.', '2010-02-11 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864032, 853107, 63633, '<td valign="top">The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation. <br/> <br/>Regarding the image itself, as a black and white I find it to be a bit "muddy", that is all shades of grey and no good range between black and white.</td>', 'The way I see it, the quote that this challenge is based on could be taken in two ways: 1. Things that matter" or things that literally count, eg an abacus etc. I don''t really understand how your image fits either interpretation.  Regarding the image itself, as a black and white I find it to be a bit "muddy", that is all shades of grey and no good range between black and white.', '2010-02-11 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864033, 852690, 63633, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet she''s a real sweetie :)<br/> <br/>I find your focus to be a bit off though, or maybe it''s camera shake.</td>', 'I''ll bet she''s a real sweetie :) I find your focus to be a bit off though, or maybe it''s camera shake.', '2010-02-11 23:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864039, 853260, 63633, '<td valign="top">A lovely sentiment and a beautiful baby. I find though that your image''s focus is a bit off, and there isn''t a good tonal range between blackest black and pure white.</td>', 'A lovely sentiment and a beautiful baby. I find though that your image''s focus is a bit off, and there isn''t a good tonal range between blackest black and pure white.', '2010-02-11 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
