(5864485, 852843, 113157, '<td valign="top">Good idea but my eye is drawn away by the only light area in the photo the distant hill.</td>', 'Good idea but my eye is drawn away by the only light area in the photo the distant hill.', '2010-02-12 12:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864494, 853165, 113157, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I think the signicance of the Peregrine will be missed by most. Stating something like Survival (recovery of the Peregrine) would have helped. As far as the photo your focus point appears to be the edge of the wing closest to the camera when it should have been on the eye. Next time try setting your camera to a single focus point and putting it on the eye or manually focus on the eye. The unlevel perch and food are a bit distracting but it helps that they are out of focus. I think a tighter crop would have been a bit better.</td>', 'Great idea! I think the signicance of the Peregrine will be missed by most. Stating something like Survival (recovery of the Peregrine) would have helped. As far as the photo your focus point appears to be the edge of the wing closest to the camera when it should have been on the eye. Next time try setting your camera to a single focus point and putting it on the eye or manually focus on the eye. The unlevel perch and food are a bit distracting but it helps that they are out of focus. I think a tighter crop would have been a bit better.', '2010-02-12 12:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5864498, 852690, 114239, '<td valign="top">blurry</td>', 'blurry', '2010-02-12 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
