(5866622, 853143, 96881, '<td valign="top">When submitting into the challenge, it is best to use the maximum amount of pixels.  Most programs allow you to adjust the ''quality'' of the image to reduce the file size (and also ''save for web'' to strip the EXIF data) means you can submit at 800px and get under the file size without a noticable difference in this size........it will help you scores</td>', 'When submitting into the challenge, it is best to use the maximum amount of pixels.  Most programs allow you to adjust the ''quality'' of the image to reduce the file size (and also ''save for web'' to strip the EXIF data) means you can submit at 800px and get under the file size without a noticable difference in this size........it will help you scores', '2010-02-14 14:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
