(5871039, 853096, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB</b> <br/> <br/>Wow, we sure do have diverse scenery in California.  This is a beauty, for sure.  And I''m glad you get to look at it instead of me.  (Brrrrrr)<br/>:-))<br/> <br/>You received a good score for this very nice image and landed in the top ten as well.    You caught it at a good time with excellent lighting on that  rock and on the sky/cloud formations.<br/> <br/>About all I can say is keep on being inspired by Nature''s architecture.  You''re doing fine.<br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB  Wow, we sure do have diverse scenery in California.  This is a beauty, for sure.  And I''m glad you get to look at it instead of me.  (Brrrrrr):-)) You received a good score for this very nice image and landed in the top ten as well.    You caught it at a good time with excellent lighting on that  rock and on the sky/cloud formations. About all I can say is keep on being inspired by Nature''s architecture.  You''re doing fine. Alice', '2010-02-17 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
