(5871323, 852678, 113900, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite and highest rated shot in the challenge.  It might have been better to focus on the belly, but I really liked this shot anyway.  Very under-appreciated IMHO.  Nice work.<br/> <br/>EDIT: I think also that another neat take on this idea might be to have the father''s hands forming the shape of the heart.  The two photos could work pretty well as companion shots.  Just an idea I had.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-17 18:20:20.</i></td>', 'This was my favorite and highest rated shot in the challenge.  It might have been better to focus on the belly, but I really liked this shot anyway.  Very under-appreciated IMHO.  Nice work. EDIT: I think also that another neat take on this idea might be to have the father''s hands forming the shape of the heart.  The two photos could work pretty well as companion shots.  Just an idea I had.', '2010-02-17 18:17:29.000000', '2010-02-17 18:20:20.000000', 0),
