(5872172, 851826, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''ve never seen so many 1''s...except on a total DNMC but, then again....look at the 4-10''s that you got LOL  Interesting that things went this way! :)  3 10''s on an attempt to get the brown...pbttttt....can''t even get that many 10''s when I''m seriously trying to get a good score LOL!!!  Ok, I''m curious now too.  Just a want to see how badly a shot could do and what it takes to get one there? LOL</td>', 'Wow, I''ve never seen so many 1''s...except on a total DNMC but, then again....look at the 4-10''s that you got LOL  Interesting that things went this way! :)  3 10''s on an attempt to get the brown...pbttttt....can''t even get that many 10''s when I''m seriously trying to get a good score LOL!!!  Ok, I''m curious now too.  Just a want to see how badly a shot could do and what it takes to get one there? LOL', '2010-02-18 11:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
