(5872176, 852950, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oh good grief!  A beautiful shot, crisp, clear, artistic and a darker area in the shot kills it???  Actually, I think the shadow kind of "frames" the shot every well and adds to the movement within the footprints, drift marks of the wind on the snow.  It all works.  And, you''re right...the footprints would be NO different if the shadow weren''t there ROFLMAO!!!  *SIGH*</td>', 'Oh good grief!  A beautiful shot, crisp, clear, artistic and a darker area in the shot kills it???  Actually, I think the shadow kind of "frames" the shot every well and adds to the movement within the footprints, drift marks of the wind on the snow.  It all works.  And, you''re right...the footprints would be NO different if the shadow weren''t there ROFLMAO!!!  *SIGH*', '2010-02-18 11:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5872318, 853096, 57202, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, all. :)  And I had no clue you were from the area, Robert!  I used to come up here on and off growing up, and finally decided a couple months ago that I wanted to live here. :D  I''m still looking for new and interesting angles to shoot the rock, but it''s just hard to take a bad shot of it!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, all. :)  And I had no clue you were from the area, Robert!  I used to come up here on and off growing up, and finally decided a couple months ago that I wanted to live here. :D  I''m still looking for new and interesting angles to shoot the rock, but it''s just hard to take a bad shot of it!', '2010-02-18 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5872323, 853032, 114271, '<td valign="top">Yeah I can help you out, and explain what I mean. Almost every other win on this site is a nature shot, and they all look the same - beautiful and poster-like. Ogremerk has a point when he writes:<br/>"Why are the second and third place winners at the same exact place?" - they proberly arent, but you get the point...<br/>I miss a little more edge and creativity in the most of the challenges!!<br/>Well thats just me. <br/>And yeah, how can this count??????????</td>', 'Yeah I can help you out, and explain what I mean. Almost every other win on this site is a nature shot, and they all look the same - beautiful and poster-like. Ogremerk has a point when he writes:"Why are the second and third place winners at the same exact place?" - they proberly arent, but you get the point...I miss a little more edge and creativity in the most of the challenges!!Well thats just me. And yeah, how can this count??????????', '2010-02-18 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 0),
